# What the shared em and en dash gate (@cosyte/script-utils, `cosyte-no-emdash`, ST34) leaves out of
# this repository. One tracked path per line; an entry ending in `/` covers every path beneath it.
#
# CHANGELOG.md holds the frozen archive below its "Released before this file was generated" divider:
# history written with dashes before the rule, already shipped in npm tarballs, and pinned byte for
# byte by test/scripts/changelog-generation.test.ts. The gate leaves out whole files, so the
# generated sections above the divider go with it; their source, `.changeset/`, is scanned in full,
# so a dash cannot reach a release section without the gate seeing it first.
CHANGELOG.md
